iator.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"28:19","t":"And when he wanted to strike the one who was an enemy to both of them, he said, \"O Moses, do you intend to kill me as you killed someone yesterday? You only want to be a tyrant in the land and do not want to be of the amenders.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"28:20","t":"And a man came from the farthest end of the city, running. He said, \"O Moses, indeed the eminent ones are conferring over you [intending] to kill you, so leave [the city]; indeed, I am to you of the sincere advisors.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"28:21","t":"So he left it, fearful and anticipating [apprehension]. He said, \"My Lord, save me from the wrongdoing people.\"","j":20,"h":39,"s":28,"a":21,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":39,"surahs":[28],"sajdah":false}